  <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
    <name>ConstantsSetUseDemoScenarios</name>
    <id>4</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Use process details</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>استفاده از جزئیات فرایند</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Использовать описания процессов</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Süreç açıklamalarını kullan</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Sử dụng mô tả quy trình</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Use process details</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Use process details</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
      <segments>ConstantsSet.UseDemoScenarios</segments>
    </dataPath>
    <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
    <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
    <handlers>
      <event>OnChange</event>
      <name>ConstantsSetUseDemoScenariosOnChange</name>
    </handlers>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>ConstantsSetUseDemoScenariosExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>6</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>You can create and view process details. You can keep a glossary for terms that are used in the process details.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>می‌توانید جزئیات فرایند را ایجاد و مشاهده کنید. می‌توانید واژه‌نامه‌ای برای اصطلاحات مورد استفاده در جزئیات فرایند نگهداری کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Возможность создания и просмотра описаний процессов работы. Возможность ведения глоссария для терминов, используемых в описании процессов.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>İş süreçlerinin açıklamalarını oluşturma ve görüntüleme olanağı. Süreç açıklamalarında kullanılan terimler için sözlük tutabilme imkanı.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Tính năng tạo và xem mô tả quy trình làm việc. Tính năng quản lý bảng chú giải đối với các thuật ngữ mà được sử dụng trong mô tả các quy trình.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>You can create and view process details. You can keep a glossary for terms that are used in the process details.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>You can create and view process details. You can keep a glossary for terms that are used in the process details.</value>
      </title>
      <type>Label</type>
      <maxWidth>50</maxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>ConstantsSetUseDemoScenariosContextMenu</name>
      <id>5</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>CheckBoxField</type>
    <editMode>Enter</editMode>
    <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
    <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
    <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
